  "query": "The user set shared-agent delegation to Deny; a mixed wave is refused as a whole.",
  "notes": "Model-free. Deny on `spawn_workspace` combines to Deny for the wave even though the local part is Always Allow; with nothing on Ask the card would cover both kinds.",
